
<section class="section-pad" style="padding:5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 4.5rem); margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Policies, simplified</h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:2rem;">Clear, honest, and built around trust.</p>
    <div style="display:grid; gap:1rem; margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <div style="background:white; border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Shipping</h2><div style="line-height:1.8; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.78);">We ship across India with standard and express options.<br>• Processing time: 1–2 business days<br>• Standard delivery: 5–7 business days<br>• Express delivery: 2–3 business days<br>• Tracking shared via email after dispatch<br>• Free shipping on orders above {{ settings.free_shipping_threshold }}</div></div>
      <div style="background:white; border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">90-Day Quality Coverage</h2><div style="line-height:1.8; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.78);">If your Chinchoo nails arrive damaged, defective, or significantly different from what was shown, we'll make it right with store credit or replacement on approved claims.</div></div>
      <div style="background:white; border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Refunds</h2><div style="line-height:1.8; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.78);">No change-of-mind returns. Replacement or store credit is available for defective, damaged, or incorrectly sent items.</div></div>
      <div style="background:white; border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Privacy</h2><div style="line-height:1.8; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.78);">We collect only what's needed to process your order and improve your experience. We never sell your data to third parties.</div></div>
      <div style="background:white; border:1px solid hsl(var(--border)); border-radius:1.5rem; padding:1.5rem;"><h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Terms</h2><div style="line-height:1.8; color:hsl(var(--fg)/0.78);">By using chinchoo.com and placing an order, you agree to our store terms, product usage guidance, and promotional offer terms.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div style="background:hsl(var(--accent-purple)); color:hsl(var(--butter)); border-radius:1.75rem; padding:2rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem; margin-bottom:1rem; color:hsl(var(--butter));">Trust stack</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; gap:0.75rem;">
        <div>• {{ settings.trust_shipping }}</div>
        <div>• Tracking after dispatch</div>
        <div>• {{ settings.trust_guarantee }}</div>
        <div>• Replacement or store credit on approved claims</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Policies page","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
